= Doc for cluster/node IP/Hostname change

Description

We need to add a new section around how to change the node/cluster IP/hostname(s) after installing a cluster.  

  Before change IP/hostname(s):

[source,bash]
----
gadmin init etcd
gadmin stop all
----

  After change IP/hostname(s):
  
[source,bash]
----
gadmin config entry System.HostList --file ~/.tg.cfg  # Edit IP/hostname here
gadmin init cluster --skip-stop --init-etcd
----
